{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "9438ff43-04e8-565a-a113-b15ff91f8835", "source_ordinal": 2701, "reading_ordinal": 1352, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "no run", "published_at": "2022-07-02T23:42:46+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/541030715/answer/2555888987"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "其实“对现状不满，进行某种归因，然后采取行动”这个行为模式本身是没什么问题的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 39}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "要说幼稚，谁不幼稚？要说浅薄，谁不浅薄？这都属于“白噪音批评”，根本没有实际意义。", "char_start": 40, "char_end": 81}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这更不因为对现状满意的人不同意这个看法就有什么大错。", "char_start": 82, "char_end": 108}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "在后者——主要是中老年人——看来，青少年归因的深刻程度、行动的有效性总是会被认为有种种的不足，这基本上是千古不变、永远恒在的现象。这就是世界运行的一般常态，站在上帝的视角去看，这就是游戏里的常规剧情安排。", "char_start": 109, "char_end": 211}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "大家都在行礼如仪，不要过于激动。", "char_start": 212, "char_end": 228}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "问题其实不在归因不够深刻、行动笨拙，而在于这一代的青少年因为互联网的原因，行动的笨拙没有迅速的得到负反馈，于是长期没有水平上的提升。", "char_start": 229, "char_end": 295}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "啥意思呢？", "char_start": 296, "char_end": 301}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "就是没有互联网之前，青少年对世界不满，只有诉诸某种行动。", "char_start": 302, "char_end": 330}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "日本的例子", "char_start": 331, "char_end": 336}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "一旦真正付诸行动，青少年才会现实的体会到自己主张的分量、代价和确切的合理性。这个过程，也恰恰是青少年成长为新一代的中老年的过程。", "char_start": 336, "char_end": 400}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你有不满，其实本身谈不上什么幼稚或者不对——至少你所不满的对象自身是没有合理立场来说这话的。", "char_start": 401, "char_end": 447}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "那肯定嘛——我不满的就是你，你当然会抓住一切用得着的说辞来说我不对。你比我阅历多，你当然会利用这一条来说我的不满“幼稚又错误”。这不是题中应有之义吗？我怎么可能仅仅因为你这么说就这么相信？", "char_start": 448, "char_end": 542}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "问题在于你要付诸行动。只有行动本身才能验证你的坚持到底是不是有客观合理性。", "char_start": 543, "char_end": 580}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "真正值得忧虑的，是这些主张和行动长期停留在嘴头上、姿态上，因为从不付诸行动，而沦为一种廉价的精神安慰剂，反而成了青年人完全投降的“平衡锤”。", "char_start": 581, "char_end": 651}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "也就是在实际上根本就没有什么反抗，而是十足十的投降，本来应该用在挑战和改变上的能量，全在这种“口嗨”之中被“满足”了，消磨掉了。", "char_start": 652, "char_end": 716}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "甚至，因为可以安全的尽情的“口嗨”，还可以将已经十分的投降，进一步发展到十二分的跪拜。", "char_start": 717, "char_end": 760}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "问题根本不在于你们叛逆，也不在于你们幼稚，而在于你们的叛逆是假的。", "char_start": 762, "char_end": 795}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你们“叛逆”得太油腻了。", "char_start": 796, "char_end": 808}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "为啥？", "char_start": 810, "char_end": 813}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "因为一开口就是“所有的路都被堵死了，也就剩口嗨而已了”。", "char_start": 814, "char_end": 842}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "把自己的不服付诸行动，就只有“违法手段”一种可能吗？", "char_start": 843, "char_end": 869}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你们为什么不尝试建立“无资本家”的企业，然后去生产点什么，去尝试竞争？", "char_start": 870, "char_end": 905}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "我没有看到你们谁做任何这样的尝试——包括失败的尝试。", "char_start": 906, "char_end": 932}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "应该有失败的尝试存在，不是吗？", "char_start": 933, "char_end": 948}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "应该有前赴后继、宁可用自己的失败为后来人开创道路的觉悟存在，不是吗？", "char_start": 949, "char_end": 983}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "这还没有要求你们抛头颅洒热血，是合法的，不是吗？", "char_start": 984, "char_end": 1008}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "这是整整一代年轻人，你们的条件比你们的父辈祖辈好千万倍。", "char_start": 1009, "char_end": 1037}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "不管是知识，还是资源，还是社会对新生产方式的宽容度，你们都没有理由说“我们的条件不如2000、90、80、70、60、50……1800”。", "char_start": 1038, "char_end": 1107}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你们的尝试呢？", "char_start": 1108, "char_end": 1115}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "哪怕众筹出一个来呢？哪怕只是你一言我一语的尝试讨论如何解决“无资本家的假想企业/社会如何解决这样那样的管理需求”的纯学术的探讨呢？", "char_start": 1116, "char_end": 1181}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "比如，无资本家的生产方式如何招聘员工？怎么纠正和判定发展战略？", "char_start": 1182, "char_end": 1213}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "讨论一下这些具体问题，也违法吗？也有人要迫害和消灭你们吗？", "char_start": 1214, "char_end": 1243}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "畅想这个蓝图，一点一点的设想具体的细节，哪怕还不去付诸实践，只是进行“预研”，也已经可以算作行动了。", "char_start": 1244, "char_end": 1294}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "“预研”呢？", "char_start": 1295, "char_end": 1301}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "你有什么程度的愤怒，你就应该有什么程度的勇敢。", "char_start": 1303, "char_end": 1326}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "有什么程度勇敢，就该有什么程度的行动。", "char_start": 1327, "char_end": 1346}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "有什么样的行动，就应该有什么样的尝试。", "char_start": 1347, "char_end": 1366}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "就该有应有的失败。", "char_start": 1367, "char_end": 1376}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "我没有看到你们本该会有的失败。", "char_start": 1378, "char_end": 1393}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "没有看到你们尝试建立但失败了的“无资本家企业”。", "char_start": 1394, "char_end": 1418}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "甚至没有看到这样思路的架空小说。", "char_start": 1419, "char_end": 1435}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "没有人在哪怕认真的幻想。", "char_start": 1436, "char_end": 1448}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "真正让人轻视的根源，根本就不是你们幼稚、鲁莽、浅薄——每一代青年都在老一辈眼里受这评价。", "char_start": 1450, "char_end": 1494}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "真正的问题是你们太圆滑、太世故了。", "char_start": 1495, "char_end": 1512}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "叛逆得太“精明”了。", "char_start": 1513, "char_end": 1523}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "只剩下“run”的“叛逆”“反抗”，算是什么东西？", "char_start": 1525, "char_end": 1550}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 51}, "divergence": true, "divergence_count": 1}, "text_lexical_divergence": [{"reason": "text_has_content_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "body", "char_start": 331, "sample": "日本的例子"}]}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0214"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待当今年轻人张口闭口就是资本家，并以无知浅薄的方式来进行所谓的对抗，妄图让社会迎合他们的幼稚？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046"], "summary": "围绕“no run”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“其实“对现状不满，进行某种归因，然后采取行动”这个行为模式本身是没什么问题的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "其实“对现状不满，进行某种归因，然后采取行动”这个行为模式本身是没什么问题的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 39, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a53b03b0-bc3c-573a-a3eb-5c329c3ff3e0", "source_ordinal": 2700, "reading_ordinal": 1353, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不听预言", "published_at": "2022-07-03T01:25:54+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/46904078/answer/2555971267"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "凡是预言人的命运，都是人自己没活醒。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "预告人的命运的极限是什么呢？", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 33}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "是基于某种极其刚性的逻辑说明“某种行为模式不具有可持续性，因此如果继续下去会有某种挫败”。", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但这种表述不构成对人的命运的预言。", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 97}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "预告跟预言有什么区别？", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 109}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "预言（prophecy）是不考虑变数的，是无视任何选择、努力与挣扎的。", "char_start": 110, "char_end": 145}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "告诉你有一天有个姓李的要推翻你的王朝，你做什么都没用。", "char_start": 146, "char_end": 173}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你把姓李的杀光也没用，自己改姓李也没用，提前自我解散也没用。", "char_start": 174, "char_end": 204}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "总之最后会应验，这就叫预言（prophecy）。", "char_start": 205, "char_end": 229}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "恶性的预言即诅咒。", "char_start": 230, "char_end": 239}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "而预告（predict / foretell / foresee / forecast）有大量的条件限定和时效限定。", "char_start": 241, "char_end": 299}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "就像天气预告，就是一种forecast。", "char_start": 300, "char_end": 320}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "它的前提是按照现有轨迹，如果不做任何干预、不考虑任何意外，那么可以根据某种可靠的逻辑预见（foresee）某种直接的后果。", "char_start": 321, "char_end": 382}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这种预见是非常有限而谦抑的，它并不能确保实现。", "char_start": 383, "char_end": 406}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你不那么做，它不就不会实现了？", "char_start": 407, "char_end": 422}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "过了它的可靠时效，后面的事怎么断言？", "char_start": 423, "char_end": 441}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你看出问题来没有？", "char_start": 442, "char_end": 451}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "说prophecy的只有先知，这是涉及神性的概念。而且prophet自己不理解自己所做的预言。", "char_start": 453, "char_end": 500}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "从神学的角度说，一个prophet只是代转神的宣告。是因为这是主宰命运和历史的神的宣告，所以它具有不可抗拒性和真理性。但它到底会以什么形式、经由什么路径实现，prophet自己也无从理解。因为prophet不是神，神也没法跟人类说清楚这事。这事涉及到人类根本不能理解的知识和人脑根本不能容纳的数据量，说也是白说。", "char_start": 501, "char_end": 657}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "但是预见和预告者是循着完全不同的路径得到自己的结论的。", "char_start": 658, "char_end": 685}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "ta们根据的是既有的经验。", "char_start": 686, "char_end": 699}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "既然是根据既有经验，就没法下绝对断言。就一定会有“不做改变、不出意外的话”这个前提。", "char_start": 700, "char_end": 742}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "加上了这个前提，这种预告就和预言（prophecy）有了根本的区别，完全不是同一种东西。", "char_start": 743, "char_end": 787}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "现在，再重复一遍——", "char_start": 788, "char_end": 798}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "预言人的命运，是一种绝对的蠢行。", "char_start": 799, "char_end": 815}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "预测、预告，你要听，但是不要听结论，而要听ta做这个预测预告的理论框架和运算依据。", "char_start": 817, "char_end": 858}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "也就是我不关心你的结论，我只关心你的理由。", "char_start": 859, "char_end": 880}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "预言（prophecy），没有听的必要。", "char_start": 882, "char_end": 902}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 32}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0214"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：10岁的孩子喜欢临摹非常精细的画，但老师说他以后在画画上不会有大发展是为什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028"], "summary": "围绕“不听预言”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“凡是预言人的命运，都是人自己没活醒。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "凡是预言人的命运，都是人自己没活醒。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "417e4884-889f-5262-9702-3e27537ba0e1", "source_ordinal": 2699, "reading_ordinal": 1354, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "溯溪鞋", "published_at": "2022-07-03T05:04:35+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/535792997/answer/2556030566"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "西方的苦恼不是不能领先，而是技术领先往往最后因为体制原因反而导致实力落后。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 37}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "原理是自己创想出来的，技术是自己摸索出来的，第一代原型是自己做出来的。", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 73}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "但中国很快会凭着制度优势和工业能力站在这个原理上推出类似的产品，而成本便宜、数量巨大。", "char_start": 74, "char_end": 117}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "先发，但却制于人。", "char_start": 118, "char_end": 127}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这的确对美国很“憋屈”，但是这就是客观事实。", "char_start": 128, "char_end": 150}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "西方已经无法拉开和中国的技术代差，但却因为工业体系和产能问题无法在数量和成本上压倒中国。", "char_start": 151, "char_end": 195}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "美国如果不实现再工业化，甚至会出现“越研发，越被动”的诡异局面。", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 228}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "现在已经不是“摸着鹰酱过河”的问题了，干脆是“踩着鹰酱过河”，把“鹰酱当成溯溪鞋穿”的问题了。", "char_start": 229, "char_end": 276}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这其实是一个非常古老的问题：", "char_start": 278, "char_end": 292}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "为什么华夏有五千年文明，却没有发展出体系化的现代科学？", "char_start": 293, "char_end": 320}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 11}, "divergence": true, "divergence_count": 1}, "text_lexical_divergence": [{"reason": "text_tail_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "tail", "char_start": 293, "sample": "为什么华夏有五千年文明，却没有发展出体系化的现代科学？"}]}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0214"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待美军表态下一代战机进入制造阶段？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“溯溪鞋”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“西方的苦恼不是不能领先，而是技术领先往往最后因为体制原因反而导致实力落后。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "西方的苦恼不是不能领先，而是技术领先往往最后因为体制原因反而导致实力落后。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 37, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "cb821afd-e3f2-57df-b04a-2b17f3d655e3", "source_ordinal": 2698, "reading_ordinal": 1355, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "先活着", "published_at": "2022-07-03T12:17:05+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/20022131/answer/2556393237"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "别的间架结构、字形问题不说了，说几个不常见人强调的点：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 27}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "1）记住笔画挥洒的节奏，先于记住字形本身。", "char_start": 28, "char_end": 49}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "先把意念从小心翼翼的描形上拿开，把一幅好字先视作一套枪法和拳法。", "char_start": 50, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "中字是为了刺出当中一枪，", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 95}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "道字是为了扫出最后一腿。", "char_start": 96, "char_end": 108}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "雲雷之中有暴雨梨花，", "char_start": 109, "char_end": 119}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "琴瑟之间有嘈嘈切切。", "char_start": 120, "char_end": 130}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "不要先问笔划，先享受轻重缓急、盘旋回绕、蓄势而发的体感。", "char_start": 131, "char_end": 159}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "看完下面这两段东西：", "char_start": 160, "char_end": 170}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "quote", "index": 10, "text": "【张峰超新星全运会】师出成家班，一套完美拳术斩获武术冠军。https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1BE411t7qR", "char_start": 171, "char_end": 243}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "quote", "index": 11, "text": "白日依山尽https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ZJ411R7dd", "char_start": 244, "char_end": 292}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "有这个节奏动作，才有这个节奏动作留下的痕迹。", "char_start": 293, "char_end": 315}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "先知道在何时踏脚，在何时翻转，在何时冲拳，", "char_start": 316, "char_end": 337}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "再掌握在何处踏脚，做何样翻转，向何方冲拳。", "char_start": 338, "char_end": 359}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "先对节奏，再对方位。", "char_start": 360, "char_end": 370}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "节奏不对，字永远是只是描出来的。", "char_start": 372, "char_end": 388}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "描字永远战战兢兢，怕越雷池一步，", "char_start": 389, "char_end": 405}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "描出来的只是美丽的尸体。", "char_start": 406, "char_end": 418}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "手舞足蹈，活蹦乱跳，丑也是活人。", "char_start": 420, "char_end": 436}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "先活着，再美丽。", "char_start": 437, "char_end": 445}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "2）你写的是一篇东西，不是一个一个的字。", "char_start": 447, "char_end": 467}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "练习的核心单元不妨设为一个成语，或者一句五言七言诗，进而一联诗。", "char_start": 468, "char_end": 500}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "而把学习字形视为“预备练习”。", "char_start": 501, "char_end": 516}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "中国传统的教法过于强调“基本功”，一横先练八千遍，一竖再写八千遍。横竖撇捺点折勾就练了个把月还没写一个字、一句话，练得一片心里一片茫然。", "char_start": 517, "char_end": 585}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这个思想是不行的。", "char_start": 586, "char_end": 595}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "练习的最小单元应该是“最小可用产品”——一副最小的作品。", "char_start": 596, "char_end": 624}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "直接写作品。所谓的预练习，只是为了哪怕写出一个最丑、最简陋的完整作品所需要的最基本知识。", "char_start": 625, "char_end": 669}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "就像学金工，第一个练习就是做把锤子。做锤子之前的技术全都先教到你能拼出第一把可用的锤子就可以。", "char_start": 670, "char_end": 717}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "练不要去一遍遍的练磨、切、削，钻，而要一遍遍的练做锤子。", "char_start": 718, "char_end": 746}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "锤子才是练习的最小单元，而不是做锤子的每一道工艺。", "char_start": 747, "char_end": 772}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "同理，书法本来也有这样的思路，比如练“永”字。但这个思路并没有真的执行好。", "char_start": 773, "char_end": 810}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "因为永字虽然“最小”，但却“不可用”。", "char_start": 811, "char_end": 830}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "不如先练自己的名字。", "char_start": 831, "char_end": 841}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "先练“花间堂”（地址）。", "char_start": 842, "char_end": 854}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "先练“中华人民共和国”。", "char_start": 855, "char_end": 867}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "这些练了就可用。", "char_start": 868, "char_end": 876}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "用了就有用户反馈，就有真正的在乎。", "char_start": 877, "char_end": 894}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "才发生强大的动力去改进每一个细节。", "char_start": 895, "char_end": 912}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "循序渐进，是从锤子作为第一起点，而不是从切、磨、削作为第一起点。", "char_start": 913, "char_end": 945}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "学书法，第一目标可以就是“云水”这两个字。", "char_start": 946, "char_end": 967}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "那就先把这两个字的作品练到能落款、能装裱、能收藏。", "char_start": 968, "char_end": 993}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "再练三个字的，四个字的。", "char_start": 994, "char_end": 1006}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "以作品的要求来要求这些字的每一个方面，尽早出作品。", "char_start": 1007, "char_end": 1032}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "从作品到作品，而不要练半年一年再出作品。", "char_start": 1033, "char_end": 1053}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "你的动力会有所不同。", "char_start": 1054, "char_end": 1064}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 48, "quote": 2}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0214"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：练字的诀窍有哪些？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045"], "summary": "围绕“先活着”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“别的间架结构、字形问题不说了，说几个不常见人强调的点：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "别的间架结构、字形问题不说了，说几个不常见人强调的点：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 27, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e6eab32b-51b4-5362-8abe-9e60799eb5c5", "source_ordinal": 2697, "reading_ordinal": 1356, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "倾国倾城", "published_at": "2022-07-03T21:47:30+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/538192516/answer/2557078198"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你这在美人们手里简直一个回合都走不过。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "美人都是些明摆着的上帝的宠儿，心地善良就罢了，黑化起来一个比一个厉害。", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 55}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "她们面前没有什么“大人物”，单凭美貌就可以傲视一切王侯将相。你如果不觉得，那是你没见过人可以美到什么地步。", "char_start": 56, "char_end": 109}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "美人能对你造成的影响，这不是图片、电影可以描述的。", "char_start": 110, "char_end": 135}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "“倾国倾城”不是跟你开玩笑的，主战坦克都保不住你。", "char_start": 136, "char_end": 161}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "没有人“不缺美人”。", "char_start": 162, "char_end": 172}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "不中美人计的不是对美麻木的人——对真正的美能保持麻木的人基本上思维也出问题了，多少有点智力障碍——而是那些知道惹不起、提前就知道给自己打预防针的人。", "char_start": 173, "char_end": 247}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "那些觉得“不就是长得漂亮点吗，我就不信我扛不住“的最容易完蛋，抗性往往最差。", "char_start": 248, "char_end": 286}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "总之，不要这么傲慢和铁齿。", "char_start": 287, "char_end": 300}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0214"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我认为美人计纯属虚构，因为那些人根本不缺美人，怎么可能中美人计呢？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009"], "summary": "围绕“倾国倾城”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你这在美人们手里简直一个回合都走不过。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你这在美人们手里简直一个回合都走不过。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1b09fbf6-006b-5ee1-b3ba-d91cadfffc5f", "source_ordinal": 2696, "reading_ordinal": 1357, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "差距", "published_at": "2022-07-04T13:28:03+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/395585298/answer/2557912076"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这是一个老答案，题目被封了，搬运一下。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这个差距远不像一般人想象的那么大。", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 37}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "当然，参数上似乎差得很远，产量上也似乎差得很远，品质上也差得很远，似乎是差一个到两个数量级。", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 84}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但是，真正的差距是原理性的差距，而不是实际上的差距。", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 111}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "人家比你强，如果是强在你没有概念的地方，你要追赶连该做什么、要做到什么样都不知道，连对方是用什么原理做出来的都不能理解，那么即使数据看起来差距不大——比如只差一两倍——实际上的技术差距却差得很远。", "char_start": 112, "char_end": 210}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "但如果人家比你强，你知道它强在哪，要做哪些功夫、培养哪些人，你知道它的原理、只是不清楚它的部分关键细节，那么即使差得很远——比如差个十倍——实际上的技术差距却很近。", "char_start": 211, "char_end": 293}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "大清朝和大英帝国的差距，单从枪炮口径、射程、重量上、船舰的航速上都没差到十来倍，尽管性能上的确差了很多，但是真正的距离是大清帝国根本不明白对方的运转原理，“疑其系牛拉”。", "char_start": 294, "char_end": 379}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这种差距，即使数据上没有差到十百倍，也是真正的鸿沟。", "char_start": 380, "char_end": 406}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "只要你知道对方的原理，知道哪怕大体的架构、知道哪怕基本的性状，你就对差在什么地方、什么具体的环节上、具体差了多少、具体该解决的问题有了一个巨大的追赶优势——这些看起来“最基本”的东西，恰恰是产品战略中最艰难、最核心和最冒险的部分。这些东西一旦做出来了，你领悟力不差的话，一眼就看到了，而对方当初不知道花了多大的人力物力和时间才断定现在的方案最好。", "char_start": 407, "char_end": 580}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "一架Su27摆在你面前，最复杂的部分看起来是发动机叶片、相控阵雷达这些，但其实从工程上讲，要不要鸭翼、全重多少、重心在哪里、要几台发动机、要几座、翼展多少、全长多少、油箱多大这类看似“低技术”的问题才是真正冒险的部分。", "char_start": 581, "char_end": 690}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "大众媒体在这个问题上津津乐道的是发动机寿命、隐身涂层这类前沿技术，但这其实误导了大众的普遍认知，让人误以为这些部分是差距的主要部分，实际上它是次要部分。", "char_start": 691, "char_end": 767}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "其实，木头帆船和蒸汽铁甲舰的差距，远远大于蒸汽铁甲舰和战列舰、战列舰和航空母舰的差距——尽管那些老式铁甲舰未必比最快的帆船快到哪去。", "char_start": 768, "char_end": 834}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "算盘和ENIAC的差距，远远大于ENIAC和80286的差距，更远远大于28nm到5nm的差距。", "char_start": 835, "char_end": 883}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "原理、方向、架构这些战略性的决策才是才是万事最难的那个开头，才是差距的主要部分。", "char_start": 884, "char_end": 924}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "明明这个“开头”才是充满血泪、汗水和长时间的苦工的地方，却是最不容易保密，最没法保护的地方。", "char_start": 925, "char_end": 971}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你会眼睁睁的看着没比你蠢、也没比你少点勤奋的对手大步的迈过你汗流浃背才迈过的沟壑，直接跳过你曾经付出血泪的歧路。而另一头你却被物理极限、元素周期表死死的卡在新的未知边疆上。", "char_start": 972, "char_end": 1058}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "要付出十倍百倍的代价才能挤进下一站，而这代价尾随者并不需要等额支付。", "char_start": 1059, "char_end": 1093}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "上天给人类开的一个最大的玩笑——或者说最大的仁慈——就是把事情安排成了这个要人命的样子。", "char_start": 1095, "char_end": 1139}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "若不是自然规律就是如此，人类在发生第一次原理跨越的时候就直接建成永恒世界帝国了。", "char_start": 1140, "char_end": 1180}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "就是因为这种对勤奋追赶者的额外恩宠直接写入了世界的客观原则，才保证了在这个世界上技术优势无法成为暴政的永久保障。", "char_start": 1181, "char_end": 1237}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "无论你多么先进，如果你的仁德不能让强有力的挑战者自己心悦诚服的愿意接纳你的优势地位，那么你就一定会在一个（不论长度如何）最终必然有限的时间内失去这种优势。", "char_start": 1238, "char_end": 1315}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "有力量只能让你坐上宝座，有仁德你才能坐稳。只要你无法让你消灭不了的挑战者心悦诚服，由自然规律保证的后发福利就一定会保证你最后失去这力量优势。", "char_start": 1316, "char_end": 1386}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "作为霸主，你只有两种可能——", "char_start": 1387, "char_end": 1401}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "1）勤修仁德，解决掉挑战者的敌意，万事大吉；", "char_start": 1402, "char_end": 1424}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "2）要么，你直接投降认输，要么与挑战者一决雌雄。", "char_start": 1425, "char_end": 1449}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "而这个“一决雌雄”，要么你输了，这也不提了；", "char_start": 1450, "char_end": 1472}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "要么你是赢了，只要你的挑战者并非浪得虚名，你几乎不可能是轻取完胜。而如果是惨胜或者干脆同归于尽，你最后还是最终输给神完气足的第二挑战者。", "char_start": 1473, "char_end": 1541}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "换句话说，第二条路选了和没选没有实际差别。", "char_start": 1542, "char_end": 1563}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "看明白没有，“天下唯有德者居之”，实际上是写入了自然法则的的绝对律令。", "char_start": 1564, "char_end": 1599}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "台积电优势是很大，但它并不能超越写入世界底层的自然法则。", "char_start": 1600, "char_end": 1628}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "美国也不能。", "char_start": 1629, "char_end": 1635}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "美国要保住王座，唯一可能的出路，就是做一个中国真心愿意尊重的领袖。", "char_start": 1636, "char_end": 1669}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "否则它失去宝座是板上钉钉的，区别只是是中国接它的位置，还是欧盟，甚至是俄罗斯、日本、印度。", "char_start": 1670, "char_end": 1715}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "不管是谁，它自己是肯定坐不下去的。", "char_start": 1716, "char_end": 1733}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "这话并不是我说的，这是几千年来所有大大小小的强权实体无一逃脱的共同命运的共同声明。", "char_start": 1734, "char_end": 1775}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "没得选择。", "char_start": 1776, "char_end": 1781}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "台积电、F22/35，福特级，SPACEX、微软，苹果、谷歌……再强大，都不会真正改变故事的结局，只是拖得了几年和花落谁家的问题。", "char_start": 1782, "char_end": 1847}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "结局没得选择。", "char_start": 1848, "char_end": 1855}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "对芯片技术的估计过于乐观？", "char_start": 1857, "char_end": 1870}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "中国大陆明明知道芯片不行，几十年前为什么不发展芯片？", "char_start": 1871, "char_end": 1897}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "路在哪里？", "char_start": 1897, "char_end": 1902}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "中国芯片产业前景到底怎么样？", "char_start": 1903, "char_end": 1917}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 43}, "divergence": true, "divergence_count": 2}, "text_lexical_divergence": [{"reason": "text_has_content_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "body", "char_start": 1871, "sample": "中国大陆明明知道芯片不行，几十年前为什么不发展芯片？"}, {"reason": "text_tail_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "tail", "char_start": 1903, "sample": "中国芯片产业前景到底怎么样？"}]}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0214"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：理性讨论，中芯国际能否赶超台积电，为华为全面供货？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042"], "summary": "围绕“差距”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这是一个老答案，题目被封了，搬运一下。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这是一个老答案，题目被封了，搬运一下。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "f455e627-834a-5efb-afe9-c311b5694325", "source_ordinal": 2695, "reading_ordinal": 1358, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "说话的兽", "published_at": "2022-07-04T19:11:27+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/530184935/answer/2558470982"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "数学本来是人类用来描述事物关系的一种语言。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "各种运算，实际上是它的具体语法。", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 38}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "我们真正的困难在于——这个描述工具似乎有点太好用了。", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 65}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "客观世界里存在的关系，必有对应的数学描述；甚至反过来，一些莫名其妙掉的数学推导甚至是纯粹的“叛逆”、可以反过来启示一些我们未曾观察到的事物的存在。", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 139}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "实际上，很多人犯了一个错误，那就是只把“使用代数符号数学的表达式”视为“数学表达”，却把直接用语言进行的描述视为非数学。", "char_start": 140, "char_end": 200}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "实际上，你稍微思考一下就会发现语言的描述和关系式的描述仅仅只有符号系统的不同。", "char_start": 201, "char_end": 240}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "实际上，当我们说“例如”、“好比”、“就像”时，我们也是在建立一种数学关系。", "char_start": 241, "char_end": 279}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "甚至，连“实际上”、“甚至”、“连”也是一种数学关系。", "char_start": 280, "char_end": 307}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "换言之，人类的整个语言体系，整个与书写和语音符号关联的表达系统，都是数学的。", "char_start": 308, "char_end": 346}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "中文也罢、英文也罢，本身就是一套复杂的符号系统，与那些用字母算符书写成的表达式没有任何本质的区别，仅仅只是写起来不同罢了。", "char_start": 347, "char_end": 408}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "任何一篇散文也罢、小说也罢、诗歌也罢、文告也罢，本质上都是一组一组的表达式。", "char_start": 410, "char_end": 448}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "语法即算法。", "char_start": 449, "char_end": 455}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "文字即代码。", "char_start": 456, "char_end": 462}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "询问是数学是人造还是自然存在，实际上就是在问语言本身是人造还是自然存在。", "char_start": 463, "char_end": 499}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "而这存在一个比较确定的答案，那就是类似“白天”、“那边”、“老虎”、“鹿”、“攻击”这样的原始词汇是否先于“我们”，“人类”这样的词存在。", "char_start": 500, "char_end": 569}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "换言之，当人类开始使用语言时，人类是否已经可以称为人类？存不存在使用原始（然而已经有足够抽象能力）的语言的动物？", "char_start": 570, "char_end": 626}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "如果存在，就足以证明语言可以先于人类存在。", "char_start": 627, "char_end": 648}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "到底人类是语言的造物，还是语言是人类的造物？", "char_start": 649, "char_end": 671}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "是一种动物被自然赐予了语言的工具，从而被这工具导入了后续的演化轨道，成为了人类，还是一种动物先成了人类，然后才“仓颉造字”，“发明了”语言？", "char_start": 672, "char_end": 742}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "而语言就是一种数学。", "char_start": 743, "char_end": 753}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "山、水、火，就是一种X，Y，Z。", "char_start": 754, "char_end": 770}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "烧、杀、养，就是一种+、-、x。", "char_start": 771, "char_end": 787}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "从种种迹象来看——这包括动物研究和人类学研究——答案是前者。", "char_start": 788, "char_end": 818}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "数学是先在的。", "char_start": 820, "char_end": 827}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "人类是它的结果，而非它是人类的结果。", "char_start": 828, "char_end": 846}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 27}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0214"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：一个高中生的疑问：数学究竟是自然界本就存在的某种联系，还是我们人类的创造？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025"], "summary": "围绕“说话的兽”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“数学本来是人类用来描述事物关系的一种语言。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "数学本来是人类用来描述事物关系的一种语言。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "bced4d35-b749-589b-bc62-b7e2d73f079e", "source_ordinal": 2694, "reading_ordinal": 1359, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不容人", "published_at": "2022-07-04T19:59:50+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/445031991/answer/2558530814"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "建议不采纳，并不叫不能容人。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "提出了一百条建议，全都没有采纳，仍然不叫不能容人。", "char_start": 15, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "提出了一百条建议不采纳，于是听到发牢骚，于是批评和敲打，仍然不能叫不能容人。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "把线重新划一划，再谈不能容人的问题。", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "作为下属，你的价值本位是提出建议，被采纳是额外的bonus。", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 129}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "上司负责决策，上司有绝对的决策自由。这不能因为你而有任何的损伤。", "char_start": 130, "char_end": 162}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "否则你就不是在帮忙，而是在扯后腿。", "char_start": 163, "char_end": 180}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "搞清楚自己是干什么的。", "char_start": 181, "char_end": 192}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你把这根线往上挪，谁也容不了你。", "char_start": 193, "char_end": 209}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "区别只是提刀的手法是不是优雅而已。", "char_start": 210, "char_end": 227}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "如果打破这条线，其实对方不是不能容人，而是不能容大爷。", "char_start": 228, "char_end": 255}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "那么，要到什么样算作不能容人呢？", "char_start": 256, "char_end": 272}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "看到某种过失，第一反应就坚信“这是有意捣乱”，这叫不能容人——能容人的第一反应都当作“这是无心之失”、“这是我没说清楚”。", "char_start": 273, "char_end": 334}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "愿意自己冒险付代价，也要给人足够的机会，这就是宽容。", "char_start": 335, "char_end": 361}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "对人所难免的问题做好宽容的准备，就叫能容人。", "char_start": 362, "char_end": 384}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "对非人所难免、超出了一般频度和烈度的问题不宽纵，不属于不容人。", "char_start": 385, "char_end": 416}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "“能容人”是指能容人类，不是指容特定的谁。", "char_start": 417, "char_end": 438}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0214"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么当下挺多中小创业公司的老板容不下人？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“不容人”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“建议不采纳，并不叫不能容人。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "建议不采纳，并不叫不能容人。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
